662 - Let All Mortal Flesh Keep Silence
 / 
Key: F
Time: 4/4
Tempo: Moderato
Number: 662
Topic: Sentences and Responses - 

Verse 1:
[Dm]Let all mortal flesh [Bb]keep [C7/Bb]silence,
[Dm]And with [C7]fear [Am]and [Bb]trembling [C7/Bb]stand;
[Bb]Ponder nothing [F]earthly-minded,
[Dm]For with [C7]blessing [Bb]in his [C7/Bb]hand,
